        "## 4. Day 4: Augmentation with Albumentations\n",
        "\n",
        "Two pipelines: `plain` (resize and normalize only, used for validation, test and the no-augmentation baseline) and `augmented` (rotation, shift, scale, flip and colour jitter, used for training only).\n",
        "The normalization uses ImageNet statistics because the pretrained backbones were trained with them."
      ],
