        "## 5. Day 2: Transfer learning mechanics\n",
        "\n",
        "Three ways to build the model (all ResNet-18 for speed):\n",
        "\n",
        "| kind | weights | what is trained | learning rates |\n",
        "|------|---------|-----------------|----------------|\n",
        "| `scratch` | random | everything | 1e-3 |\n",
        "| `frozen` | ImageNet | only the new classifier head (feature extraction) | head 1e-3 |\n",
        "| `finetune` | ImageNet | everything (fine-tuning) | head 1e-3, **backbone 1e-4 (much smaller)** |\n",
        "\n",
        "A frozen backbone needs a normal learning rate on the new head. Full fine-tuning needs a much smaller rate for the pretrained layers, otherwise large updates wreck the pretrained weights."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "Ywi8dbqNpi5r"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "def make_model(kind, n_classes):\n",
        "    if kind == \"scratch\":\n",
        "        m = torchvision.models.resnet18(weights=None)\n",
        "    else:\n",
        "        m = torchvision.models.resnet18(weights=torchvision.models.ResNet18_Weights.DEFAULT)\n",
        "    m.fc = nn.Linear(m.fc.in_features, n_classes)          # new classifier head\n",
        "    if kind == \"frozen\":\n",
        "        for name, p in m.named_parameters():\n",
        "            p.requires_grad = name.startswith(\"fc.\")\n",
        "    return m\n",
        "\n",
        "def make_opt(model, kind, lr_head, lr_backbone):\n",
        "    if kind == \"frozen\":\n",
        "        return torch.optim.Adam(model.fc.parameters(), lr=lr_head)\n",
        "    if kind == \"finetune\":\n",
        "        head = list(model.fc.parameters())\n",
        "        head_ids = {id(p) for p in head}\n",
        "        backbone = [p for p in model.parameters() if id(p) not in head_ids]\n",
        "        return torch.optim.Adam([{\"params\": backbone, \"lr\": lr_backbone}, {\"params\": head, \"lr\": lr_head}])\n",
        "    return torch.optim.Adam(model.parameters(), lr=lr_head)\n",
        "\n",
        "def set_train(model, kind):\n",
        "    model.train()\n",
        "    if kind == \"frozen\":                       # keep BatchNorm statistics of the frozen backbone fixed\n",
        "        for m in model.modules():\n",
        "            if isinstance(m, nn.BatchNorm2d):\n",
        "                m.eval()\n",
        "\n",
        "for kind in [\"scratch\", \"frozen\", \"finetune\"]:\n",
        "    m = make_model(kind, n_classes)\n",
        "    trainable = sum(p.numel() for p in m.parameters() if p.requires_grad)\n",
        "    print(f\"{kind:9s} trainable params: {trainable/1e6:.2f}M\")"
      ],
